<section class="card"><h2>AI Ads plans</h2><p class="sub">Pick the level of creative help that suits your business. Meta charges your ad spend directly.</p><div class="notice"><?= !empty($has_ads_access)?'AI Ads access is active through '.html_escape($subscription['expires_at']??''):'No AI Ads plan is active for this store. Choose a plan below to get started.'; ?></div><?php $availableOffers=0; foreach($subscription_offers as $offer): if(empty($offer['enabled'])||(int)($offer['total_kobo']??0)<1) continue; $availableOffers++; $period=(string)($offer['billing_period']??''); $caps=$offer['entitlements']??array(); ?><div class="campaign"><strong><?= html_escape($offer['plan_name']??'AI Ads'); ?> · <?= html_escape(ucfirst($period)); ?> · ₦<?= number_format(((int)$offer['total_kobo'])/100,2); ?><?= !empty($offer['tax_included'])?' (tax included)':''; ?></strong><p><?= (int)($caps['copy_generations_per_month']??20); ?> ad-copy suggestions · <?= (int)($caps['ai_images_per_month']??2); ?> AI images · <?= (int)($caps['ai_video_generations_per_month']??0); ?> short AI videos. Start a video from a description or your own product photo. Store up to <?= (int)($caps['media_storage_mb']??100); ?> MB of campaign media</p><form method="post" action="<?= base_url('marketing/ai_ads/subscribe'); ?>" style="margin:8px 0"><input type="hidden" name="<?= html_escape($csrfName); ?>" value="<?= html_escape($csrfHash); ?>"><input type="hidden" name="product_code" value="<?= html_escape($offer['product_code']??''); ?>"><button class="btn" type="submit">Choose <?= html_escape($offer['plan_name']??'plan'); ?></button></form></div><?php endforeach; if(!$availableOffers): ?><div class="notice">Plans are temporarily unavailable. You can still connect your Meta account and prepare drafts.</div><?php endif; ?><?php if(!empty($has_ads_access)): $usage=$usage_snapshot??array(); $used=$usage['used']??array(); $limits=$usage['limits']??array(); ?><div class="notice">This month you have <?= max(0,(int)($limits['copy_generations_per_month']??20)-(int)($used['copy_generations']??0)); ?> ad-copy suggestions, <?= max(0,(int)($limits['ai_images_per_month']??2)-(int)($used['ai_images']??0)); ?> AI images, <?= max(0,(int)($limits['ai_video_generations_per_month']??0)-(int)($used['ai_video_generations']??0)); ?> short AI videos remaining. Each can start from a description or your own media. Storage used: <?= number_format(((int)($used['media_bytes']??0))/1048576,1); ?> MB of <?= (int)($limits['media_storage_mb']??100); ?> MB. Annual plans receive their allowances monthly.</div><?php endif; ?><p class="muted">Payment is once per term; renewal is manual. Meta charges ad spend directly to your advertising account. Annual plans receive their creative allowance monthly.</p></section>
